# Whitelist: git sees only the files listed below. Everything else in this folder stays hidden: LaTeX build files,
# __pycache__, new outputs, scratch files, macOS metadata. To track another file, add a line  !/path/to/file
# (paths are relative to this folder). Files git already tracks stay tracked whatever this file says.

# hide everything...
*
# ...but still look inside folders, so the files below can be found
!*/

